{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2021-11-12 13:56:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS INC. NAMES STEPH DISHER VICE PRESIDENT – CUMMINS FILTRATION', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) ANNOUNCED THAT STEPH DISHER HAS BEEN NAMED VICE PRESIDENT – CUMMINS FILTRATION, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 15. DISHER BEGAN LEADING THE FILTRATION BUSINESS IN AUGUST 2020, NAVIGATING THE BUSINESS DURING THE GLOBAL PANDEMIC AND RELATED ONGOING SUPPLY CHAIN CONSTRAINTS. THROUGH THESE CHALLENGES, THE BUSINESS CONSISTENTLY HAS DELIVERED SOLID FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE. DISHER HAS LED THE BUSINESS AS CUMMINS EXPLORES STRATEGIC ALTERNATIVES FOR IT,'}